# Judge8-1-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:安安是从<br>二楼的阳台<br>坠落致死……|#0203Trial01_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她非常倒霉地<br>落到楼下的铁栅栏上，<br>被铁栅刺死。|#0203Trial01_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你是说……<br>这是偶然导致的意外死亡？|#0203Trial01_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:对。<br>从现场的状况来看，<br>安安应该是<br>滑了一跤。|#0203Trial01_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……可是啊。<br>那根铁栅……<br>是从尸体的背后插入的对吧。|#0203Trial01_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:要说人是<br>意外从阳台坠落，<br>这我可以理解，可是……|#0203Trial01_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我打个比方，<br>如果她是<br>靠在阳台的护栏上时<br>掉下去的，<br>那正常来说<br>身体应该是<link=\"Objection_02_03_01_01\">正面朝下</link>才对吧？|#0203Trial01_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这个嘛……<br>说不定<br>她是在<br>坠落的过程中<br>失去平衡……|#0203Trial01_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她是<br>从二楼<br>掉到一楼对吧？|#0203Trial01_Alisa004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:高度顶多<br>只有几米而已。|#0203Trial01_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在这么短的时间内<br>扭转身体用后背着地，<br>这合理吗？|#0203Trial01_Alisa006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不能说<br>完全不可能，<br>但说不定<br>其中有什么原因。|#0203Trial01_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:例如，<br>阳台本来就坏掉了。|#0203Trial01_Leia006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"唔～……<br>可是诺亚觉得，<br>昨天画室的阳台<br>应该<link=\"Objection_02_03_01_02\">没有坏</link><br>才对～……|#0203Trial01_Noah001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆動揺

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这、<br>这不对吧……！|#0203Trial01_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
